      "writtenOn": "2023-11-29T14:23:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This function will not handle that. It verifies the raw DICE chain prior to parsing any fields. The kernel hash check necessitates the extraction of some specific fields from `DiceChainEntryPayload`.\n\nThere is a `TODO(b/271275206)` to verify the Microdroid kernel code/authority hash, near the `DiceChainEntryPayload::code_hash`.",
